    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but the \"validating\" part doesn't really change the fact that the version of me that actually mattered is gone. i feel like a movie that already reached its climax and is now just playing the credits over and over in an empty theater. there's no more plot left. i'm just sitting here waiting for the screen to go black, but it won't. it just lingers in this weird, useless state.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
